[[264,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237728\">1048A59</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Loosen the band (1a) and remove the hos from the air filter to\nthe rigid pipe (1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2014595.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[264,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Place the hose from the air filter to the\nrigid pipe back in its housing and tighten the band.</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237728\">1048A59</a>\n                                           .</p>"]]